**Cognia-RE Automated Reference Document Generation Pipeline**

An n8n-based automation pipeline that generates SDS, SRS, and BRS reference documentation from backend and frontend GitHub repositories using Cognia-RE, OpenCode, and Ollama Cloud.

The main workflow manages component processing, execution tracking, and orchestration, while the subworkflow handles source code scanning, document generation, validation, and GitHub publishing.

Generated documents are published to component-specific feature branches, with automated Pull Request creation, execution logging, and status tracking.
